<title>USA: Ballantyne of Omaha files for share offer.</title>
<headline>Ballantyne of Omaha files for share offer.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballantyne of Omaha Inc said Monday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on behalf of its majority shareholder, ARC International Corp, and other stockholders, relating to a proposed public offering of 1,964,000 shares of Ballantyne.</p>
<p>ARC is offering 1,705,000 shares, and other stockholders are offering the rest. Ballantyne will not be selling any shares in the offering.</p>
<p>Following completion of the offering, Ballantyne will have 8,850,269 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co and Prudential Securities Inc are acting as the managing underwriters.</p>
